ally meet its Net Zero target by  2050 polling last year showed the 30  percent of companies don't even have a  plan in spite of promises to reduce air  emissions aviation emissions are  expected to rise dramatically  sustainable air travel from start to  finish is still a long way off Lisa  Holland Sky News
 

